{"itemid":"1151470","languages":{"english":{"app[content][legal]":"Copyright © 2006  manbago Manuel Bago Cobo. All rights reserved.","app[content][about]":"[p][b]Sabor de España: The Hoops Challenge[\/b] is an interactive experience that blends aim, geography, and the rich culinary culture of Spain.[\/p][p align=&quot;start&quot;]Do you consider yourself a gourmet expert? Prove it by controlling our advanced [b]Bull-Bot Launcher[\/b] on a gastronomic journey through the country's 52 provinces. From Andalusian Gazpacho to Canary Islands' Papas Arrugás, every dish must land in its place of origin.[\/p][h2 align=&quot;start&quot;][b]Features:[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p][b]📍 Full Geography[\/b]: Challenge yourself with all 52 provinces of Spain, each featuring its most iconic dish.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🐂 Unique Bull-Bot[\/b]: A one-of-a-kind launcher you can control with pinpoint precision.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]💡 Play and Learn[\/b]: Unlock fun facts and culinary secrets with every hit. You're not just playing; you're learning why Spain tastes the way it does![\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🔥 Streak System[\/b]: Chain hits to earn extra lives and wildcards. Aim carefully for the &quot;x7 Combo&quot;![\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🎨 Vibrant Art[\/b]: High-quality cartoon design, smooth and full of color.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]💃 Original Soundtrack[\/b]: Flamenco rhythms to keep you in the perfect mood for the challenge.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p align=&quot;start&quot;]Prepare yourself for the ultimate culinary challenge![\/p]","app[content][short_description]":"Test your aim and culinary knowledge in Sabor de España! Launch iconic Spanish dishes to their correct provinces on the map. 52 provinces, hundreds of dishes, and a robot-bull await. Can you score them all?","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"Windows 10 (64-bit)","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"1.6 GHz Dual Core\t","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"Intel HD Graphics 3000 or equivalent","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"DirectX Compatible Sound Card","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":"A display resolution of at least 1280x720 is recommended for the best experience. The game requires a 64-bit processor and operating system"},"french":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"italian":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"german":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"spanish":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"[p][b]Sabor de España: The Hoops Challenge[\/b] es una experiencia interactiva que mezcla puntería, geografía y la rica cultura culinaria española.[\/p][p align=&quot;start&quot;]¿Te consideras un experto gourmet? Demuéstralo controlando a nuestro avanzado [b]Robot-Toro lanzador[\/b] en un viaje gastronómico por las 52 provincias del país. Desde el Gazpacho andaluz hasta las Papas Arrugás de Canarias, cada plato debe aterrizar en su lugar de origen.[\/p][h2 align=&quot;start&quot;][b]Características:[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p][b]📍 Geografía Completa[\/b]: Desafíate con las 52 provincias de España, cada una con su plato más icónico.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🐂 Robot-Toro Personalizable[\/b]: Un lanzador único que puedes controlar con precisión milimétrica.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]💡 Aprende Jugando[\/b]: Desbloquea curiosidades y secretos gastronómicos con cada acierto. No solo juegas, ¡aprendes por qué España sabe cómo sabe![\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🔥 Sistema de Rachas[\/b]: Encadena aciertos para ganar vidas y comodines. ¡Apunta bien para ganar el &quot;Combo x7&quot;![\/p][\/*][*][p][b]🎨 Arte Vibrante[\/b]: Diseño cartoon de alta calidad, fluido y lleno de color.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]💃 Banda Sonora Original[\/b]: Ritmos flamencos que te mantendrán en el mood perfecto para el desafío.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p align=&quot;start&quot;]¡Prepárate para el desafío culinario definitivo![\/p]","app[content][short_description]":"¡Pon a prueba tu puntería y tus conocimientos gastronómicos en Sabor de España! Lanza los platos típicos a su provincia correspondiente en el mapa. 52 provincias, cientos de platos y un robot-toro te esperan. ¿Podrás encestarlos todos?","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"bulgarian":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"czech":{"app[content][legal]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][notes]":""},"schinese":{"app[content